{"id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-kurtzrandom.md","title":"Kurtz 随机性","display":"df-kurtzrandom — Kurtz 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-kurtzrandom","aliases":["43-df-kurtzrandom"],"display":"df-kurtzrandom — Kurtz 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-kurtzrandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-kurtzrandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurtzrandom — Kurtz 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的 Borel σ 代数。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等价于属于每个测度1的有效开集。有效闭零集比一般ML零集窄。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的 Borel σ 代数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$P\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]，$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$P\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]，$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1278,"backlinks":[{"id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$E_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 采用 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]] 的有限串代码；$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A$、$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。本节引入相对检验 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A$、相对随机性 $\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A$ 及两个一元低性谓词 $\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}$、$\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]] — Kurtz 随机性"},{"id":"0e25902f9c93ca41","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)$，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]；有效开集与测度见 [[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"0920735961e5851c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；谓词见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。"},{"id":"ce78261af74de716","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。"},{"id":"959b7a3f4e264cd5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。"},{"id":"05e098cce7fb11ad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Kurtz随机性与有效开集见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]，$\\mu$ 及其定义域 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。"},{"id":"e664edf227d0e59a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；各随机性谓词见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]。"},{"id":"72143341cae87069","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]，$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]；柱集、测度和有效开集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","cc07cf2b9ec0019e","8e999d59227f4a28"]}